OL,3,GNEWSAJolly Fisherman art
OL,4,A'deteriorating' due to sea air
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Irreplaceable" artwork depicting the
OL,7,FJolly Fisherman skipping on Skegness
OL,8,Fbeach has deteriorated because of
OL,9,Fexposure to the sea air, the town
OL,10,Fcouncil has been told.
OL,12,FThe mascot was first painted by John
OL,13,FHassall for a poster campaign
OL,14,Fadvertising the resort in 1908.
OL,16,FThe blue pigment on Jolly's jumper and
OL,17,Fthe sea have darkened over time in two
OL,18,Fpaintings now owned by the town
OL,19,Fcouncil.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
