OL,3,GNEWSAJolly Fisherman art
OL,4,A'deteriorating' due to sea air
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe town clerk said the paint has been
OL,7,Faffected by a "chemical reaction to the
OL,8,Fsea air" but that the council had
OL,9,Fcommissioned work to prevent "further
OL,10,Fdeterioration".
